{%- comment -%}
  Renders product content — QR Crest Builder (2026 redesign, inline section)

  ========================================================================
  CHANGE LOG
  ========================================================================
  v13.1 — Upload flow upgrades:
          • Uploaded images are center-cropped to a square BEFORE being
            stored — fixes oversize/overflow when users upload portrait
            or landscape source images. Max output is 800x800 PNG.
          • Uploaded QR is decoded with jsQR — the embedded URL is
            extracted and shown in the preview + details summary +
            sessionStorage payload + cart 'QR Link' property.
          • SVG uploads bypass the crop (vector remains crisp).
  v13   — Ray feedback 5/22:
          • "Choose Crest"       → "Crest Position"
          • "Memorable Color"    → "Umbrlux Colour" (British spelling)
          • "QR Card Color"      → "Umbrlux Colour" in details row
          • "QR Color"           → "QR Colour" in details row + cart property
          • Dropped California/Yellow — back to 7 city colours
          • New "Upload your QR" modal — user uploads existing QR image
            (PNG/JPG/SVG), it's saved to sessionStorage and rendered on
            the canvas in place of a generated QR. Tabs let the user
            switch between "Generate QR" and "Upload QR".
  v12 — Crest positions recalibrated per client spec.
  v11 — Details summary clarifies QR Color (contrast) vs QR Card Color.
  v10 — Removed localStorage canvas-PNG storage; CTA disabled until size.
  v9  — Memorable Color hardcoded (not a Shopify variant).
  v8  — Sold-out sizes get disabled + struck through.
  v7  — Variant resolver wired into add-to-cart.
  v6  — Consolidated responsive ladder.
  v5  — Crest visual redone to match brand sample.
  v4  — First brand-styled crest.
  v3  — QR LOCKED.
  v2  — Removed popup shell.
  v1  — Replaced legacy theme markup with 2026 design.
  ========================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} ========== QR CREST BUILDER STYLES ========== {%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  /* ---------- design tokens (scoped to .qr-builder to avoid theme bleed) ---------- */
  .qr-builder {
    --ublx-bg:        #fafaf7;
    --ublx-card:      #ffffff;
    --ublx-ink:       #141413;
    --ublx-ink-2:     #3d3d3a;
    --ublx-muted:     #73726c;
    --ublx-line:      rgba(31,30,29,0.12);
    --ublx-line-2:    rgba(31,30,29,0.2);
    --ublx-accent:    #1DCDB5;
    --ublx-radius:    10px;
    --ublx-radius-sm: 8px;
    --ublx-radius-lg: 12px;

    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--ublx-radius-lg);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    color: var(--ublx-ink);
  }
  .qr-builder * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  /* ---------- header / breadcrumb ---------- */
  .qr-builder .header {
    padding: 0.25rem 0 1rem;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--ublx-line);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .qr-builder .breadcrumb-navigation {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ublx-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .qr-builder .breadcrumb-navigation a { color: var(--ublx-muted); text-decoration: none; }
  .qr-builder .breadcrumb-navigation a:hover { color: var(--ublx-ink); }
  .qr-builder .breadcrumb-navigation .current-product { color: var(--ublx-ink); font-weight: 500; }

  /* ---------- two-panel grid (MOBILE FIRST: single column) ---------- */
  .qr-builder .main-contents {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .qr-builder .panel { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; border: 1px solid #1f1e1d1f; }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .qr-builder .panel.left-content {
      position: sticky;
      top: 20px;
    }
  }
  .qr-builder .panel-header {
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ublx-muted); font-weight: 500;
    border: none;
  }
  .qr-builder .panel-content {
    background: var(--ublx-card);
    border-radius: var(--ublx-radius);
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  /* ---------- view tabs ---------- */
  .qr-builder .view-tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .qr-builder .view-tab {
    flex: 1; padding: 10px; background: transparent;
    color: var(--ublx-muted);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--ublx-line);
    border-radius: var(--ublx-radius-sm);
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 1px;
    cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .qr-builder .view-tab:hover { border-color: var(--ublx-line-2); color: var(--ublx-ink); }
  .qr-builder .view-tab.active { background: var(--ublx-ink); color: #fff; border-color: var(--ublx-ink); }

  /* ---------- canvas ---------- */
  .qr-builder .canvas_image {
    aspect-ratio: 1/1;
    max-height: 600px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fafafa 0%, #f0f0f0 100%);
    border-radius: var(--ublx-radius-sm);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    padding: 1rem; position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .qr-builder #mockup-canvas {
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: 100% !important;
    max-height: 100% !important;
    height: auto !important;
    border: none !important;
  }
  .qr-builder .placement-badge {
    position: absolute; top: 12px; left: 12px;
    z-index: 10;
    font-size: 10px; padding: 4px 10px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
    border-radius: 100px; letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--ublx-ink); font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* ---------- placement controls (hidden in current build) ---------- */
  .qr-builder .placement-controls { display: none; }

  .qr-builder #qr-pos-x[readonly],
  .qr-builder #qr-pos-y[readonly] {
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    color: var(--ublx-muted);
    cursor: default;
  }
  .qr-builder .position-inputs { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .qr-builder .position-input { flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .qr-builder .position-input > span { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ublx-muted); }
  .qr-builder #qr-pos-x,
  .qr-builder #qr-pos-y { text-align: center; }
  .qr-builder #save-qr-btn {
    height: 95%; padding: 0 14px;
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    background: var(--ublx-ink); color: #fff;
    border: none; border-radius: var(--ublx-radius-sm);
    cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap;
    min-width: 85px;
  }
  .qr-builder #save-qr-btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; }

  /* ---------- right panel meta ---------- */
  .qr-builder .product-meta { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .qr-builder .product-meta .eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px; color: var(--ublx-muted);
    letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .qr-builder .product-meta h1 {
    font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 6px; font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ublx-ink); line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .qr-builder .product-meta .price { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ublx-ink); }

  .qr-builder .field { margin-top: 1.25rem; }
  .qr-builder .field-label {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    font-size: 11px; color: var(--ublx-ink-2);
    letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* ---------- QR SOURCE TABS (Generate / Upload) ---------- */
  .qr-builder .qr-source-tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .qr-builder .qr-source-tab {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    background: transparent;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ublx-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s;
    font-family: inherit;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--ublx-muted);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .qr-builder .qr-source-tab:hover { color: var(--ublx-ink); }
  .qr-builder .qr-source-tab.active {
    color: #fff;
    background: var(--ublx-ink);
  }

  .qr-builder .qr-source-panel { display: none; }
  .qr-builder .qr-source-panel.active { display: block; }

  /* ---------- UPLOAD QR INPUT (inside Upload tab) ---------- */
  .qr-builder .qr-upload-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .qr-builder .qr-upload-trigger {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 11px 12px;
    background: var(--ublx-card);
    border: 1px dashed var(--ublx-line-2);
    border-radius: var(--ublx-radius-sm);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ublx-ink-2);
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.15s;
    font-family: inherit;
  }
  .qr-builder .qr-upload-trigger:hover {
    border-color: var(--ublx-ink);
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
  }
  .qr-builder .qr-upload-trigger.has-image {
    border-style: solid;
    background: rgba(29,205,181,0.08);
    border-color: var(--ublx-accent);
    color: var(--ublx-ink);
  }
  .qr-builder #qr-upload-input { display: none; }

  /* ---------- MEMORABLE COLOR ---------- */
  .qr-builder .color-hero {
    aspect-ratio: 16/9;
    border-radius: var(--ublx-radius-sm);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 14px;
    background: var(--ublx-accent); transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .qr-builder .color-hero svg { width: 90%; height: 100%; }
  .qr-builder .color-hero-meta {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .qr-builder .color-hero-meta .label-stack .l1 {
    font-size: 10px; color: var(--ublx-muted);
    letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin-bottom: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .qr-builder .color-hero-meta .label-stack .l2 {
    font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ublx-ink); text-transform: capitalize;
  }
  .qr-builder .color-hero-meta .hex {
    font-size: 10px; color: var(--ublx-muted);
    letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
  }
  .qr-builder #qr-colors {
    display: grid !important;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 8px; margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .qr-builder .color-box {
    width: 100% !important; height: 50px !important;
    aspect-ratio: 1 !important;
    border-radius: var(--ublx-radius-sm) !important;
    cursor: pointer; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08) !important;
    transition: transform 0.12s, box-shadow 0.12s;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.25) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 50%),
      linear-gradient(225deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.0) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.18) 100%);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }
  .qr-builder .color-box:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px -2px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }
  .qr-builder .color-box.active {
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--ublx-ink), 0 4px 10px -2px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  /* ---------- CREST POSITION (formerly "Choose Crest") ---------- */
  .qr-builder .qr {
    display: grid !important;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 6px;
    flex-direction: initial !important;
    align-items: stretch !important;
  }
  .qr-builder .qr_section { display: contents !important; }
  .qr-builder .qr_code { display: block !important; }
  .qr-builder .qr_code button[data-qr-style] {
    width: 100% !important; height: auto !important;
    aspect-ratio: 1.7 !important;
    margin: 0 !important; padding: 6px 4px !important;
    background: var(--ublx-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--ublx-line);
    border-radius: var(--ublx-radius-sm);
    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px; color: var(--ublx-ink-2);
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px; transition: all 0.15s;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .qr-builder .qr_code button[data-qr-style] {
      aspect-ratio: 1 !important;
    }
  }
  .qr-builder .qr_code button[data-qr-style].active {
    border: 2px solid #000; background: #000; color: #fff;
  }
  .qr-builder .qr_code button[data-qr-style]::before {
    content: ""; width: 18px; height: 18px;
    background: currentColor;
    -webkit-mask: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='currentColor'><path d='M3 3h7v7H3V3zm2 2v3h3V5H5zm9-2h7v7h-7V3zm2 2v3h3V5h-3zM3 14h7v7H3v-7zm2 2v3h3v-3H5zm9 0h2v2h-2v-2zm0 3h2v2h-2v-2zm3-3h2v2h-2v-2zm0 3h4v2h-4v-2zm3-3h2v2h-2v-2zm0-3h2v2h-2v-2z'/></svg>") no-repeat center / contain;
            mask: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='currentColor'><path d='M3 3h7v7H3V3zm2 2v3h3V5H5zm9-2h7v7h-7V3zm2 2v3h3V5h-3zM3 14h7v7H3v-7zm2 2v3h3v-3H5zm9 0h2v2h-2v-2zm0 3h2v2h-2v-2zm3-3h2v2h-2v-2zm0 3h4v2h-4v-2zm3-3h2v2h-2v-2zm0-3h2v2h-2v-2z'/></svg>") no-repeat center / contain;
  }
  .qr-builder .qr_code button[data-qr-style]:hover { opacity: 0.8; }

  /* ---------- QR CONTRAST presets ---------- */
  .qr-builder .qr-contrast { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }
  .qr-builder .qr-contrast button {
    padding: 12px;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--ublx-line);
    border-radius: var(--ublx-radius-sm);
    background: var(--ublx-card);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px; cursor: pointer; color: var(--ublx-ink);
  }
  .qr-builder .qr-contrast button .chip {
    width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }
  .qr-builder .qr-contrast button[data-contrast="black"] .chip { background: #000; }
  .qr-builder .qr-contrast button[data-contrast="white"] .chip { background: #fff; }
  .qr-builder .qr-contrast button.active {
    background: var(--ublx-ink); color: #fff; border-color: var(--ublx-ink);
  }
  .qr-builder .qr-contrast button.active .chip { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #fff; }

  /* ---------- SIZE row ---------- */
  .qr-builder .qr-style-section {
    display: grid !important;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr) !important;
    gap: 5px !important; flex-wrap: initial !important;
  }
  .qr-builder .qr_style { display: block; }
  .qr-builder .size-btn {
    width: 100% !important; height: auto !important;
    aspect-ratio: 1.3/1 !important; margin: 0 !important;
    background: var(--ublx-card);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--ublx-line);
    border-radius: var(--ublx-radius-sm);
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ublx-ink); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .qr-builder .size-btn:hover { border-color: var(--ublx-line-2); }
  .qr-builder .size-btn[style*="solid #000"],
  .qr-builder .size-btn[style*="solid black"] {
    background: var(--ublx-ink) !important; color: #fff !important;
  }

  /* Sold-out size buttons: disabled + struck-through */
  .qr-builder .size-btn:disabled,
  .qr-builder .size-btn.sold-out {
    cursor: not-allowed !important;
    opacity: 0.4;
    text-decoration: line-through;
    background: var(--ublx-card) !important;
    color: var(--ublx-muted) !important;
    border-color: var(--ublx-line) !important;
  }
  .qr-builder .size-btn:disabled:hover,
  .qr-builder .size-btn.sold-out:hover {
    border-color: var(--ublx-line) !important;
    transform: none;
  }

  /* ---------- QR LINK input ---------- */
  .qr-builder #qr-link-input {
    width: 100%; padding: 11px 12px; font-size: 13px;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--ublx-line);
    border-radius: var(--ublx-radius-sm);
    background: var(--ublx-card); color: var(--ublx-ink); outline: none;
  }
  .qr-builder #qr-link-input:focus { border-color: var(--ublx-ink-2); }

  /* ---------- QR details summary ---------- */
  .qr-builder .qr-details {
    margin-top: 1.25rem; padding: 12px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.025);
    border-radius: var(--ublx-radius-sm);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;
  }
  .qr-builder .qr-details .detail-row {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 11px; color: var(--ublx-muted);
  }
  .qr-builder .qr-details .detail-row strong {
    color: var(--ublx-ink-2); font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .qr-builder .qr-details .detail-row span:not(strong) {
    color: var(--ublx-ink); font-weight: 500;
    text-align: right;
    word-break: break-all;
    max-width: 60%;
  }

  /* ---------- CTA ---------- */
  .qr-builder #place-order-btn {
    width: 100% !important; height: auto !important;
    padding: 13px !important;
    background: var(--ublx-ink) !important; color: #fff !important;
    border: none !important;
    border-radius: var(--ublx-radius-sm) !important;
    font-size: 12px !important; font-weight: 500 !important;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px !important; cursor: pointer;
    text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 1.25rem;
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
  }
  .qr-builder #place-order-btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
  .qr-builder #place-order-btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.55;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    background: var(--ublx-muted) !important;
  }
  .qr-builder #place-order-btn:disabled:hover { opacity: 0.55; }
  .qr-builder .trust-row {
    display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 14px;
    font-size: 10px; color: var(--ublx-muted);
    margin-top: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  /* ---------- legacy fabric.js hooks ---------- */
  .canvas-container { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: 100% !important; height: stretch !important; }
  .upper-canvas { cursor: default; }

  /* ============================================================
     QR UPLOAD MODAL
     ============================================================ */
  .qr-upload-modal {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 9999;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 1rem;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal.is-open { display: flex; }
  .qr-upload-modal .modal-backdrop {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .modal-panel {
    position: relative;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    max-width: 480px;
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 90vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .modal-close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px;
    right: 12px;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #73726c;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .modal-close:hover { color: #141413; }
  .qr-upload-modal h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    color: #141413;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .modal-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #73726c;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .dropzone {
    border: 2px dashed rgba(31,30,29,0.2);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s;
    background: #fafaf7;

    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
  }

  #qr-upload-input {
    visibility: hidden;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    position: absolute;
  }

  .qr-upload-modal .dropzone:hover,
  .qr-upload-modal .dropzone.is-dragging {
    border-color: #1DCDB5;
    background: rgba(29,205,181,0.05);
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .dropzone-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
    color: #73726c;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .dropzone-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #141413;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .dropzone-hint {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #73726c;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .processing {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #73726c;
    text-align: center;
    display: none;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .processing.is-shown { display: block; }
  .qr-upload-modal .processing::before {
    content: "";
    display: inline-block;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    margin-right: 6px;
    border: 2px solid #1DCDB5;
    border-top-color: transparent;
    border-radius: 50%;
    vertical-align: middle;
    animation: cd-spin 0.8s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes cd-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

  .qr-upload-modal .preview-wrap {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: #fafaf7;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: none;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .preview-wrap.is-shown { display: block; }
  .qr-upload-modal .preview-img {
    max-width: 180px;
    max-height: 180px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(31,30,29,0.08);
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: block;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .preview-filename {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #73726c;
    word-break: break-all;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .preview-decoded {
    margin-top: 10px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    background: rgba(29,205,181,0.1);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #141413;
    word-break: break-all;
    text-align: left;
    display: none;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .preview-decoded.is-shown { display: block; }
  .qr-upload-modal .preview-decoded strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #08846f;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .preview-decoded.is-warn {
    background: rgba(255,165,0,0.08);
    color: #884400;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .preview-decoded.is-warn strong { color: #884400; }
  .qr-upload-modal .modal-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .modal-btn {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(31,30,29,0.2);
    background: #fff;
    color: #141413;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: inherit;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .modal-btn.is-primary {
    background: #141413;
    color: #fff;
    border-color: #141413;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .modal-btn.is-primary:disabled {
    opacity: 0.4;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .modal-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .modal-error {
    margin-top: 10px;
    padding: 10px;
    background: rgba(229,75,32,0.08);
    color: #c33;
    font-size: 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: none;
  }
  .qr-upload-modal .modal-error.is-shown { display: block; }

  /* ============================================================
     RESPONSIVE LADDER
     ============================================================ */

  /* ---- Tiny mobile (< 480px) ---- */
  @media (max-width: 479px) {
    .qr-builder { padding: 0.5rem; }
    .qr-builder .panel-content { padding: 0.75rem; }
    .qr-builder .qr-style-section { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr) !important; }
    .qr-builder .qr { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .qr-builder .color-box { height: 44px !important; font-size: 11px; }
    .qr-builder .product-meta h1 { font-size: 18px; }
    .qr-builder .breadcrumb-navigation { font-size: 10px; }
    .qr-builder .placement-badge { top: 6px; left: 6px; font-size: 9px; padding: 3px 8px; }
  }

  /* ---- Tablet (768–1023px) ---- */
  @media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1023px) {
    .qr-builder { padding: 1.25rem; }
    .qr-builder .main-contents {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
    .qr-builder .panel-content { padding: 1rem; }
    .qr-builder #qr-colors { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
    .qr-builder .product-meta h1 { font-size: 22px; }
  }

  /* ---- Desktop landscape (>= 1024px) ---- */
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .qr-builder .main-contents {
      grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .qr-builder .panel-content { padding: 1.25rem; }
    .qr-builder #qr-colors { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
    .qr-builder .product-meta h1 { font-size: 26px; }
    .qr-builder #place-order-btn { padding: 15px !important; font-size: 13px !important; }
  }

  /* ---- Mobile landscape (short screens) ---- */
  @media (orientation: landscape) and (max-height: 500px) {
    .qr-builder { padding: 0.5rem; }
    .qr-builder .main-contents {
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
    .qr-builder .panel-content { padding: 0.75rem; }
    .qr-builder .header { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .qr-builder .product-meta h1 { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .qr-builder .product-meta { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .qr-builder .field { margin-top: 0.75rem; }
    .qr-builder .color-hero { aspect-ratio: 16/5; }
    .qr-builder .color-box { height: 38px !important; font-size: 11px; }
    .qr-builder #qr-colors { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
    .qr-builder #place-order-btn { padding: 10px !important; margin-top: 0.75rem; }
  }
</style>

